- Story & Context: The morning after a sudden downpour, young Lela found a peculiar, shimmering oil slick on the Sungai Ketik, forming a transient, unnatural "ghost rainbow" that seemed to hum with a low frequency, a portent of the escalating market stall fee dispute the Mak Cik Jaga were gathering to confront. "You cannot paint over what is already stained!"
